<title>USA: Amtran says Dan Quayle resigns from board.</title>
<headline>Amtran says Dan Quayle resigns from board.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amtran Inc said Dan Quayle, former vice president of the United States, resigned from its board of directors.</p>
<p>&quot;Amtran has no immediate plans to replace Quayle, whose vacancy brings the company's board membership to eight, including George Mikelsons, founder and chairman,&quot; said the holding company for American Trans Air.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
